      <div style="font-size: 1em; margin: 2.2em;">
         
         <p>Illinois Valley Community College campuses in Oglesby and Ottawa will be closed for
            Thanksgiving break from Wednesday, November 25, through Sunday, November 29.</p>
         
         <p>Classes, student services, and offices will resume normal operating hours on Monday,
            November 30.</p>
         
         <p><strong>Construction Notice:</strong> Parking Lot 8 (ADA) is complete and is re-open for use. Parking Lots 1, 7, and 8
            will continue to be accessed at the north entrance. Parking Lots 4, 5, and 6 can be
            accessed at the south entrance.</p>
         
         <p>Visitors are able to park in Lots 1 and 7. There are directional signs throughout
            campus to help you reach the appropriate lots. Thank you for your cooperation!</p>
         </div>
